summary: CA basic smoke — Dogtag standalone (pkispawn)
description: |
  TMT port of a smoke subset of .github/workflows/ca-basic-test.yml.
  Provenance: Dogtag GHA Basic CA (pkispawn + DS).
  Parity target: same checks against IPACTA in freeipa (idm-8254-tmt-ca-basic).

  Requires Docker on the test host and a local pki-runner image
  (build via Dockerfile target pki-runner, or load from GHA cache).

  See tests/tmt/ca-basic-smoke/README.md
discover:
    how: fmf
    test:
        - /tests/tmt/ca-basic-smoke
provision:
    how: local
prepare:
    how: shell
    script:
      - |
        command -v docker >/dev/null \
          || { echo "ERROR: docker required for ca-basic-smoke"; exit 1; }
execute:
    how: tmt
finish:
    how: shell
    script:
      - |
        # best-effort cleanup if a previous run left containers
        docker rm -f pki ds 2>/dev/null || true
        docker network rm example 2>/dev/null || true
tag:
    - ca
    - dogtag
    - idm-8254
    - tier1
link:
    - verifies: https://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/IDM-8254
    - relates: https://github.com/dogtagpki/pki/blob/master/.github/workflows/ca-basic-test.yml
